        {
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Payment Types Supported:",
              "bold": true
            },
            " Ensure the provider supports the payment methods your customers typically use. Among other things, it includes digital wallets like Google Pay, UPI, and Buy Now Pay Later (BNPL), as well as debit and credit cards."
